      <button id="feature-prev" type="button" aria-label="Anterior" class="feature-arrow hidden sm:flex absolute top-1/2 left-2 sm:left-4 -translate-y-1/2 items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white border border-[#E7E2F5] text-[#7C3AED] shadow-[0_10px_20px_-10px_rgba(124,58,237,0.4)] z-20">
        ‹
